          <p class="src__text font-proxima">
            "This product has completely changed my life. I feel clear-headed, energized, and overall well. I sleep
            better and feel like I’m 25 again. You have a loyal customer now! Donna W."
          </p>
          <p class="src__meta font-proxima hide-on-mobile">Donna W. | Verified Buyer</p>
          <p class="src__meta font-proxima hide-on-desktop">
            Donna W. <br>
            <span>Verified Buyer</span>
          </p>
        </div>

